{"id":"915f4b454f730559","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-p-neq-exp.md","title":"thm-p-neq-exp (P is strictly contained in EXP)","display":"thm-p-neq-exp (P is strictly contained in EXP)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-exp]]","[[28-df-dtime]]","[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]"],"display":"thm-p-neq-exp (P is strictly contained in EXP)","label":"28-thm-p-neq-exp","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-p-neq-exp","P ≠ EXP","P is strictly contained in EXP"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e2f71764c556aa9\" href=\"?note=5e2f71764c556aa9\" title=\"28-df-exp\">28-df-exp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"acebbed2a6b79dac\" href=\"?note=acebbed2a6b79dac\" title=\"28-thm-time-hierarchy\">28-thm-time-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-p-neq-exp (P is strictly contained in EXP)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-p-neq-exp"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-p-neq-exp</span><span>P ≠ EXP</span><span>P is strictly contained in EXP</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(n)=2^{\\lceil(n+2)/2\\rceil}\">\\(h(n)=2^{\\lceil(n+2)/2\\rceil}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n)=2^{n+2}\">\\(g(n)=2^{n+2}\\)</span>；两者为时间可构造函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{EXP}\">\\(\\mathbf{EXP}\\)</span> 采用容许机器常数因子的资源并类定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\\subseteq\\mathrm{DTIME}(h)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DTIME}(g)\\subseteq\\mathbf{EXP},\n\\qquad\\mathbf P\\subsetneq\\mathbf{EXP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P\\subseteq\\mathrm{DTIME}(h)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DTIME}(g)\\subseteq\\mathbf{EXP},\n\\qquad\\mathbf P\\subsetneq\\mathbf{EXP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一多项式最终被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 支配，有限短输入的最大比值可吸收到机器常数。且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(n)\\log h(n)=o(g(n))\">\\(h(n)\\log h(n)=o(g(n))\\)</span>，时间层级定理给出严格中间包含。旧稿在精确时间界定义下直接从“最终支配”推出包含有短输入缺口，现与原书一致使用常数因子。</p>\n<p>来源核对：由定理3.1推出；印刷69页；PDF95页；原书§4.3末总结亦陈述P严格包含于EXP，印刷92页、PDF118页。本地代入推导已核对。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：本地代入推导已核对，但一般时间层级上游的完整证明仍受限。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-exp","status":"resolved","id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-exp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-time-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"acebbed2a6b79dac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-dtime]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"h(n)=2^{\\lceil(n+2)/2\\rceil}","display":false},{"tex":"g(n)=2^{n+2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{EXP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P\\subseteq\\mathrm{DTIME}(h)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DTIME}(g)\\subseteq\\mathbf{EXP},\n\\qquad\\mathbf P\\subsetneq\\mathbf{EXP}.","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"h(n)\\log h(n)=o(g(n))","display":false}],"bytes":1510,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层次结论：[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-p-neq-exp]]、[[28-thm-savitch]]、[[28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-immerman-szelepcsényi]]。"}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","5e2f71764c556aa9","9ed6fa1ce1934897","acebbed2a6b79dac"]}